   "ANSWER": "<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">A Circular Queue is a linear data structure in which the last position is connected back to the first position, forming a circle. It follows the FIFO (First-In-First-Out) principle, just like a regular queue. However, in a circular queue, when the rear of the queue reaches the last position of the array, it wraps around to the beginning of the array (if there is free space), using modulo arithmetic.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">It is especially useful in situations where memory needs to be used efficiently and continuously without shifting elements, such as in CPU scheduling, buffering, and gaming systems.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Difference Between Linear Queue and Circular Queue:</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<table class=\"Table\" style=\"border:solid windowtext 1px\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Aspect</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Linear Queue</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Circular Queue</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Structure</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Simple straight-line array</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">End is connected to the beginning (circular structure)</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Space Utilization</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Wastes space after some deletions</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Utilizes all available space using wrap-around</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Rear Movement</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Stops at the end of the array</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Wraps around using (rear + 1) % size</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Efficiency</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Less efficient due to shifting or unused space</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">More efficient and space-optimized</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Overflow Condition</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">When rear == size - 1</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">When (rear + 1) % size == front</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Usage</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Suitable for small, simple queues</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; padding:.100px .100px .100px .100px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Suitable for buffers, real-time systems, and scheduling algorithms</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
